  - text: I've been connecting a few dots
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Happy
  - text: Well I've been doing the opposite. I have so many questions. And a few
      comments. And a lot of rage
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: What's been going on, my guy
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: Stretch is some kind of deadly ninja, and Storm is a jerk
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Mad
  - text: And the sky is blue.. If I knew it was her dojo I wouldn't have signed
      up
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 0
    face: Confused
  - text: She stole my family sword.. And then it came back to me?
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: It did what?
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 6
    face: Confused
  - text: "When I got back home, it was just laying on my bed. And when I was just
      walking down the street, I saw\u2026"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: (You hesitate to tell him about the spirit. Are you going insane?)
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 5
    face: Confused
  - text: Listen, you said strange things happen here, and they seem to have to do
      with my sword. I get the feeling you know something
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "The sword has a spirit, man. A soul. It\u2019s talking to you"
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: "A s\u2013 s\u2013 how do you know"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Idle
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Blank
  - text: "You really didn\u2019t pay attention in class at all, did you"
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Blank
  - text: "All this stuff about \u2018Murica Points kinda put me to sleep. Do you
      really believe any of that?"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: "Look, it\u2019s simple. All techniques, bull crap or otherwise, take power
      from your soul, and your soul comes from the weapon you wield."
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Happy
  - text: Do you know why families go to war to protect their weapons? Because a
      family weapon is special - it contains the souls of all your ancestors., the
      ones who died wielding them. And they pick up a little flavor of all the people
      they hurt, and a little more from the people they kill
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Confused
  - text: "You\u2019re saying my sword has\u2026 a soul? But that can\u2019t be,
      my mother made this one herself. She said it was only for defense in case of
      an emergency ninja attack - not that i\u2019ve ever even seen one. We really
      just use it for settling... household disputes."
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: "She\u2019s definitely still alive, for better or for worse. And as far
      as I know, she\u2019s never killed"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: I dunno, man. Has she?
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: ...
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Blank
  - text: "Can\u2019t tell ya, man. I just call em as I see em, them\u2019s the rules.
      The weapon picks up the souls, and the souls give you power."
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: "And if it\u2019s true your sword is alive with a soul - it has its own
      will too. Sometimes it\u2019ll fight you, and sometimes it\u2019ll help"
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Happy
  - text: "Do you think that\u2019s why it came back? Do you think it\u2019s trying
      to.. show me something?"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: Show you what?
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Confused
  - text: "(You breath a heavy sigh... Here goes)\nI saw a ghostly animal - a sheep
      - on my way back from the dojo. Maybe I\u2019m just sleep deprived"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Confused
  - text: "That\u2019s more than just a hallucination, lil guy. That weird red blade
      is definitely trying to tell you something. I can see it in its little shifty
      red eye"
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: Embarrassed
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Confused
  - text: "(Suddenly, you get a message on your iPhone. It\u2019s from your PORTA-COMM.)"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: Idle
    cameraAngle: 2
    face: Blank
  - text: "Well, thanks for the lesson. I should be getting back home, someone\u2019s
      calling me!"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: HandsOnHips
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Happy
  - text: Be careful, Spartan. Weeeeird woo-woo is going on around here. That sword
      may not have much in the way of power, but it's showing you the way
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 7
    face: Confused
  - text: "I\u2019ll get to the bottom of this, believe it"
    name: Spartan Jack
    character: {fileID: 0}
    pose: ArmsCrossed
    cameraAngle: 4
    face: Confused
  - text: Seeya later, hater
    name: Big Sam
    character: {fileID: 518409683}
    pose: Explaining
    cameraAngle: 3
    face: Happy
  turnToFace: 1
  snapPlayerPosition: 1
